    "what_en": "Claude adds captions to an existing single-subject talking-head video without editing the footage. It transcribes speech, mattes the subject, then builds a default lower-third verbatim rail plus peak words embedded behind the subject. Output: final.mp4.",
    "when_en": "Triggers when you want captions on a single-subject talking-head video — verbatim, VFX-style, or a named style. Needs one speaker, speech, and a visible face; multi-shot clips are refused.",
    "say_en": [
      {
        "text": "Add plain captions to this talking-head video",
